lass=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Next to the <a href=\"/wiki/Reaper_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Reaper of Bhaal\">Reaper of Bhaal</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Justen\" title=\"Justen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Justen.png/25px-Portrait_Justen.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Justen.png/38px-Portrait_Justen.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Justen.png/50px-Portrait_Justen.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Justen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Justen.png/25px-Portrait_Justen.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Portrait_Justen.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Justen\" title=\"Justen\">Justen</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-121&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;935</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>To gain admittance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a>, you must cross <a href=\"/wiki/Manslaughter_Chasm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Manslaughter Chasm\">Manslaughter Chasm</a>. But if you are weak, like this aspirant, the <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Farslayer</a> will deny you passage. Defeat him or die.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202751\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36137/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7865/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpens